    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't be afraid. These bug girls aren't here to hurt you (most of them, anyway).  You're a human garbage man, but one fateful morning you accidentally ask a giant housefly out on a date. Play through a handful of bite-sized dates in this chapter-based visual novel world with point and click exploration elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use point and click mechanics to explore an island, room by room, talking to an assorted cast of different bugs and humans (and crabs). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Date a handful of different bug girls, learn how they live their lives, and help them with their problems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from different choices that may determine how the date goes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through a chapter-based storyline. New chapters will be released in the future. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute, cartoony art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectable candies! </p>",
